          {
            "title": "Question: Within a range",
            "id": 93205,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>age</code> özelliğinin <code>10</code> ve <code>20</code> gibi iki sayı arasında olup olmadığını hangi koşul kontrol eder?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>age &lt;= 20</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir aralığı kontrol etmek için <code>column BETWEEN lower AND upper</code> kullan. Aralık iki uç noktayı da içerir.</p><p>En az <code>10</code>, en fazla <code>20</code> yaşındaki hastalara ihtiyacın var. Hangi koşul çalışır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>age &lt;= 20</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>age BETWEEN 20 AND 10</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>age BETWEEN 10 AND 20</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 93206,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu sorguda ne yanlış?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" patients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>WHERE</code>'den sonra bir sütun adı olmalı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sorguda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>WHERE</code>'den sonra bir sütun adı olmalı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>10</code> ile <code>20</code> yaşındaki hastaları istiyorsun. Hangi düzenleme bu sorgunun <code>age</code> alanını kontrol etmesini sağlar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" patients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>WHERE</code> ifadesinden hemen sonra <code>age</code> ekle</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>WHERE</code> yerine <code>age</code> yaz</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>AND</code> ifadesinden hemen sonra <code>age</code> ekle</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>WHERE</code> ifadesinden hemen sonra <code>age</code> ekle.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
